{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<h5>被控酒店房謀殺前女友</h5>\n<p>被告勞浚銘（被控時 28 歲）被控一項謀殺罪。控罪指，被告於 2022 年 6 月 29 日至 6 月 30 日期間，於香港尖沙咀麗思卡爾頓酒店一房間內謀殺女子周慧賢。</p>\n<p>案件由原訟庭法官郭啟安會同 5 男 2 女陪審團審訊。控方代表為外聘大律師韋浩棠、高級檢控官陳穎琛；辯方代表為大狀 David Boyton。</p>\n<blockquote>HCCC148/2024</blockquote>\n<blockquote>HCCC148/2024</blockquote>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T04:03:52.264205+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":193,"images":0,"source":"The Witness","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T03:41:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T03:57:24.353592+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T03:57:24.353592+00:00","content_hash":"e419192053f2fe33b6814e1bae583757076e9fd9ae852bc210550009a9329858","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}